desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "S3 Public RW Bucket"
	title_zh: "S3 Public RW Bucket"
	type: vuln
	level: high
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-s3-public-rw-bucket"
	risk: "access-control"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
S3 bucket with public read-write access detected.

### 风险类型
访问控制缺陷（access-control）

### 影响
资源或接口的访问权限设置不当，可能允许越权访问。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-200: Exposure of Sensitive Information to an Unauthorized Actor
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
按最小权限原则配置访问控制，并验证所有请求的授权状态。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.tf": <<<POS
acl = "public-read-write"
POS
	"safefile://pos.tf": <<<NEG
acl = "private"
NEG
)

${*.tf}.pattern_regex(/(?:acl\s+=\s+"public\-read\-write")/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "high",
	title: "S3 Public RW Bucket",
	title_zh: "S3 Public RW Bucket",
	message: "S3 Public RW Bucket detected.",
}
